claim.claim-text:
determine at least one feature variable based on the plurality of point cloud data points;
determine a first classification statistic based on the at least one feature variable;
determine a second classification statistic based on the at least one feature variable; and
determine an object class corresponding to the object based on the first classification statistic and the second classification statistic.

a laser source configured to output a carrier wave;
a modulator configured to modulate the carrier wave to provide the carrier wave as the transmit beam; and
one or more scanning optics configured to transmit the transmit beam.

determining a first closest match between the first classification statistic and a set of first classification statistics to estimate that the object is in a first object class of a plurality of object classes;
determining a second closest match between the second classification statistic and a set of second classification statistics to estimate that the object is in a second object class of the plurality of object classes; and
assigning the first object class as the selected object class to the object responsive to the first object class being the same as the second object class.

transmitting a transmit beam having at least one of a frequency or a phase that is modulated over time;
receiving a return beam from reflection or scattering of the transmit beam by an object;
outputting a data signal comprising a plurality of point cloud data points representing the object;
determining at least one feature variable based on the plurality of point cloud data points;
determining a first classification statistic based on the at least one feature variable;
determining a second classification statistic based on the at least one feature variable; and
determining an object class corresponding to the object based on the first classification statistic and the second classification statistic.
